# Cursor Rules - Trading System Architecture

## Cursor MDC Rules

This project uses Cursor's Markdown Cursor (.mdc) rule files for documentation and code guidance. All rule files must follow the proper MDC format:

### MDC Rule Structure
```yaml
---
description: "Brief description of the rule's purpose"
globs:
alwaysApply: false
---

# Rule Title

Rule content in Markdown format...
```

### Available Rules
- `.cursor/rules/job-orchestration-pattern.mdc` - Complete implementation guide for job orchestration
- `.cursor/rules/worker-patterns.mdc` - Worker implementation patterns and best practices
- `.cursor/rules/orchestration-quick-reference.mdc` - Quick reference for job orchestration
- `.cursor/rules/mdc-rule-structure.mdc` - Documentation for creating new MDC rules
- `.cursor/rules/development-best-practices.mdc` - Development workflow and process management guidelines

